  "story": {
    "day": 37,
    "title": "Kaya's Day",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a lovely Wednesday in February.",
      "Kaya, a Japanese student, sat by her window.",
      "She thought about her future job in Japan.",
      "Maybe a firefighter, or a police officer?",
      "She heard a story about a vet from Hong Kong.",
      "Everyone talked about this vet's favorite recipe.",
      "He made delicious salmon with purple apples.",
      "Kaya smiled, touching her ear.",
      "Later, on Saturday, they went to the supermarket.",
      "\"Hi, Kaya! Thank you for helping me,\" her mom said.",
      "She saw a blue backpack for her trip to Finland or Sydney."
    ]
  }
}